From {{inh|en|enm|erthe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|eorþe}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*erþō}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₁er-||earth|id=earth}}. More at {{m|en|earth}}.

