===Conjunction===
{{head|ga|conjunctions}} {{q|triggers {{ga-mut-link|e}}, takes dependent form of irregular verbs}}

# [[that]] {{q|used to introduce a [[subordinate clause]]}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|ga|Deir sé '''go''' bhfuil [[deifir]] air.|He says that he is in a hurry.}}
# {{n-g|used to introduce a subjunctive optative}}
