#: {{ux|inline=1|ga|'''Go''' maire tú é!|May you live to enjoy it!}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|ga|'''Go''' raibh maith agat.|Thank you.|lit=May you have good.}}
# [[until]], [[till]]
#: {{syn|ga|go dtí go}}
#: {{ux|inline=1|ga|Fan '''go''' dtiocfaidh sé.|Wait until he comes.}}
# {{lb|ga|Munster}} {{ng|introduces an indirect relative clause}}
