#: {{ux|en|I’ve heard that song on the radio so many times that I’m starting to get '''sick''' of it.}}
#* {{quote-song|en|lyricist=|composer=|title=w:Same Old Love|url=|album={{w|Revival (Selena Gomez album)|Revival}}|artist=w:Selena Gomez|year=2015|passage=I’m so '''sick''' of that same old love, the kind that breaks your heart.}}
