===Etymology===
{{inh+|en|enm|sodenly}}, {{m|enm|sodeynly}}, {{m|enm|sodeinliche}}, {{m|enm|sodaynlyche}}; equivalent to {{af|en|sudden|-ly|id2=adverbial}}.

===Pronunciation===
