#: {{syn|en|tick|q1=UK|checkmark}}
#* {{RQ:King Mist|passage=Norton had made a neat, lawyerly '''check''' beside each of the items he and Billy had picked up—half a dozen or so, including the milk and a six-pack of Coke.}}
# {{senseid|en|Q80042}} {{lb|en|US}} An order to a [[bank]] to [[pay]] [[money]] to a named person or entity.
