===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|seventhe}}, {{m|enm|sefte}}, from {{inh|en|ang|seofoþa}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*sebundō}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*sebundô}}. The ''-n-'', lost in northern Proto-West Germanic, was later reinserted by analogy with {{m|en|seven}}, equivalent to {{af|en|seven|-th|id2=ordinal}}.

