====Adverb====
{{en-adv|er}}

# In or to an [[elevated]] position.
#: {{ux|en|How '''high''' above land did you fly?}}
#: {{ux|en|The desks were piled '''high''' with magazines.}}
# In or at a great [[value]].
#: {{ux|en|Costs have grown '''higher''' this year again.}}
# At a [[pitch]] of great [[frequency]].
#: {{ux|en|I certainly can't sing that '''high'''.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The adverb '''''high''''' and the adverb '''{{m|en|highly}}''' should not be confused.
*: {{ux|en|He hung the picture '''high''' on the wall.}}
*: {{ux|en|As a politician, he isn't esteemed too '''highly'''.}}

