* Catalan: {{t+|ca|tampoc}}
* Chinese:
*: Mandarin: {{t+|cmn|也不}}
* Danish: {{t|da|heller}}
* Dutch: {{t|nl|ook (niet)}}
* Estonian: {{t+|et|samuti}}
