#* {{quote-book|en|year=1978|url=https://www.jstor.org/stable/932295|title=Discant and the Theory of Fifthing
|passage=Each of these three groups contributes some special insight into the nature of fifthing and the context in which it was practiced.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|informal}} To support something fifth, after four others have already done so.
#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Tregonhorke’s First Trip in a Man-of-War|journal=Hunt’s Yachting Magazine|volume=the third|location=London|publisher=Hunt and Son,{{nb...|6, New Church Street, West, Edgware Road}}; Simpkin, Marshall, & Co.,{{nb...|Stationers’ Hall Court}}|month=January|year=1854|page=14|passage=A lisping young “Soundings,” or master’s assistant, sung out “I ''thecond'' the ''mothon'',” instantly transferring ''his'' beer to our hero’s face. In short the resolution was ''thirded'', ''fourthed'', '''''fifthed''''', and ''sixthed'', all following suit with the swipes:{{...}}}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=w:Talbot Baines Reed|title=Tom, Dick, and Harry. A School Story.|journal=[[w:The Boy's Own Paper|The Boy’s Own Paper]]|volume=XV|issue=729|date=31 December 1892|page=212|column=2|passage=It was then moved, seconded, thirded, fourthed, and '''fifthed''', “that Jarman be, and is hereby hung, and ought to be kicked.”}}
#* {{quote-web|en|year=2017|url=http://www.indiewire.com/2017/11/tv-shows-mental-health-homeland-hannibal-1201897306/|title=Critics Pick the TV Shows That Get Mental Health Right — IndieWire Survey
|site=indiewire.com
|passage=Though seconding (or '''fifthing''') the praise for “BoJack Horseman” and “In Treatment,” I think I’ll use the majority of my space to discuss “You’re the Worst.”}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|nonstandard}} To divide by five.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2006|url=https://books.google.ca/books?id=0kOJvLyf55wC&pg=PA188|title=Mathematics for Dyslexics: Including Dyscalculia|page=188
|passage=3/5 has been through '''fifthing'''. 2/3 has been through thirding. Therefore, 3/5 now needs thirding and 2/3 needs '''fifthing'''}}

