tenth.content:
==English==
{{wp}}
{{number box|en|10}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|tenth|tenth, tenthe}}. {{inh|en|ang|-}} had {{m|ang|tēoþa}} (origin of Modern {{cog|en|tithe}}), but the force of analogy to the cardinal number "ten" caused Middle English speakers to recreate the regular ordinal and re-insert the nasal consonant. Ultimately from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*tehundô}}. Equivalent to {{af|en|ten|pos1=numeral|-th|id2=ordinal|pos2=suffix forming ordinals}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|tĕnth|a=UK,US}}, {{IPA|en|/tɛnθ/|[tʰɛn̪θ]}}
** {{IPA|en|/tɪnθ/|aa=pin-pen}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-tenth.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛnθ|;|ɪnθ|a2=pin-pen|s=1}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{form of|en|The [[ordinal numeral]] form|ten}}; next in order after that which is [[ninth]].
#* {{quote-book|en|title=Easy Phraseology for the Use of Those Persons Who Intend to Learn the Colloquial Part of the Italian Language|passage=My dear young lady, here I am for the '''tenth''' time.|year={{ante|1776}}|author=Joseph Baretti|page=221|authorlink=Giuseppe Marc'Antonio Baretti|chapter=Dialogue the Fortieth|publisher=Joseph Bocca|location=Turin|edition=1835|url=https://www.google.com.au/books/edition/Easy_Phraseology_for_the_Use_of_Those_Pe/nlEVAAAAYAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=0}}
#* {{RQ:Dickens Tale of Two Cities|chapter=The Substance of the Shadow|page=214|passage=These words are formed by the rusty iron point with which I write with difficulty in scrapings of soot and charcoal from the chimney, mixed with blood, in the last month of the '''tenth''' year of my captivity.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Jamie Guirola|title='Alligator Alcatraz' detainees on hunger strike for 10th day, protesting conditions|magazine=w:NBC News|url=https://www.nbcnews.com/news/latino/alligator-alcatraz-hunger-strike-detainees-protest-conditions-rcna222554|date=2025-08-01|passage=A hunger strike at a South Florida immigration detention center state officials have named “Alligator Alcatraz” has entered its '''tenth''' day, as detainees protest what they call inhumane and dangerous living conditions.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250808055412/https://www.nbcnews.com/news/latino/alligator-alcatraz-hunger-strike-detainees-protest-conditions-rcna222554}}
# Being one of ten [[equal]] [[part#Noun|parts]] of a [[whole]].
#* {{RQ:King James Version|Ezekiel|45|11|passage=The Ephah and the Bath shal be of one measure, that the Bath may containe the '''tenth''' part of an Homer, and the Ephah the '''tenth''' part of an Homer: the measure thereof shall be after the Homer.}}

