#* {{RQ:Knolles Turkes
|passage=Neither was he ignorant what report '''ran''' of himselfe.}}
# To have growth or development.
#: {{ux|en|Boys and girls '''run''' up rapidly.}}
#* {{RQ:Mortimer Husbandry
|passage=or the Richness of the Ground cause them [turnips] to '''run''' too much to Leaves}}
# To tend, as to an effect or consequence; to incline.
#* {{RQ:Bacon Essayes|chapter=Of Nature in Men|passage=A man's nature '''runs''' either to herbs or weeds.}}
