# {{l|en|winter}}
#* {{RQ:ang:Bede Miller Ecclesiastical History|page=154|text=...þis ēalond hafað myċele lengran dagas on sumera, ⁊ swā ēac nihta on '''wintra''', þonne ðā sūðdǣlas middanġeardes.|t=...this island has much longer days in the summer, and equally longer nights in the '''winter''', than the southern parts of the world..}}
