{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|wey}}, {{m|sco|wee}}, {{cog|nl|wegen}}, {{cog|de|wiegen}}, {{m|de|wägen}}, {{cog|da|veje}}, {{cog|nb|veie}}, {{cog|nn|vega}}. {{doublet|en|wedge|wagon|way|vector}}.
