|title=Norwich 3-3 Blackburn
|url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport2/hi/football/15413656.stm
|passage=It proved a '''big''' miss as Hoilett produced a sublime finish into the top corner of the net from 20 yards after evading a couple of challenges in first-half stoppage time.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2023-01-25|author=Cem Davis tells Nick Brodrick|title=A warm 'Waterloo family' welcome|journal=RAIL|issue=975|page=38|text="It's not about having a catchy strap line, it's about 'why do I come to work every day?' Am I just here to go 'your train is over there'? Or am I here to really influence that person's journey and therefore the perception of the organisation we're working for? There is a '''bigger''' picture to this - and that ultimately is what will keep people using our service."}}
