==Danish==

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|da|gmq-oda|planetæ}}, borrowed from {{der|da|la|planēta}}, from {{der|da|grc|πλανήτης|t=wanderer, planet}}, an agent noun of {{m|grc|πλανάω|πλανάομαι|t=to wander}}. The name refer to the observation that the planets wander on the sky in contrast to the so-called fixed stars. 

====Pronunciation====
